    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Many artists "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "create",
            "ref": "v-create"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " works of art "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "outdoors",
            "zh": "在户外"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". But Olga Belka is cooler than that. She paints deep under the Red Sea*!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Olga teaches "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "diving",
            "ref": "v-diving"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " for both children and "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "adults",
            "zh": "成年人"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". She has always wanted to share "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "marine",
            "zh": "海洋的"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " beauty with other people."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "She thinks photos and videos cannot show the "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "magic",
            "zh": "魅力"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " of the sea. But she feels that painting may just be the best way for her to do so."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "To paint one picture, Olga dives for two to six hours. She "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "carefully",
            "ref": "v-carefully"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "studies",
            "zh": "研究"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "scenes",
            "zh": "景色"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " around her. Sometimes, she uses a little "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "imagination",
            "zh": "想象力"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " for her works."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Olga calls herself an “underwater painter”. She even hosted an "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "exhibition",
            "ref": "v-exhibition"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " of her paintings. Take a look at the underwater world through Olga’s eyes."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "*Red Sea 红海,位于非洲东北部和阿拉伯半岛之间的狭长海域。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "i1",
        "type": "imageRef",
        "image": "img1"
      }
